:''Not to be confused with [[Chocolate_Rabbits#Country_Rabbits|Marigold]], a Country Faction Rabbit.''

'''Marigold''' is an [[NPC]] in the [[Royal Mines]] section of the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}. They have an [[Essence Shops|Essence Shop]] where the player can purchase perks using {{Item|Gold Essence}} after defeating a {{MobSprite|Golden Goblin}}.

